		Description: "<span style=\"color:DarkTurquoise\">Lucas</span> has invited you over to his house to hang out. This is an important first step in any young friendship! <span style=\"color:DarkTurquoise\">Lucas</span> lives next door to you in <span style=\"color:Teal\">Northend</span>. He said he can normally have friends over most days until <span style=\"color:Teal\">7PM</span>, though isn’t available Wednesdays. You should pay him a visit!",
